# Building a Dedicated Application or website

The reference implementation included in this repository is intentionally backend-focused. Many organizations will find that integrating Talent Prism into their existing systems is sufficient.

If you decide to build a dedicated application around Talent Prism, the following mockups illustrate one possible user experience. They are provided as design references rather than implementation requirements.

You may share these mockups with your internal engineering team or any external development agency to accelerate the design and implementation process.

The interface can be implemented using any modern frontend framework or low-code platform, including React, Next.js, Vue, Angular, FlutterFlow, Bubble, Retool, or your organization's preferred technology stack.

The visual design, user experience, authentication, recruiter workflows, dashboards, reporting, notifications, and integrations are intentionally left to each organization, allowing Talent Prism to be adapted to existing operational processes rather than requiring agencies to change how they work.

> [!NOTE]
The mockups represent one possible implementation of Talent Prism. They are not required for the reference implementation and are intended only as a starting point for organizations building a production-ready application.
