## Live Processing Dashboard

![Live Processing Dashboard displaying applicant ingestion progress, workflow execution, and processing status.](../../assets/frontend/01-live-processing-dashboard.png)

Purpose

Provides operational visibility into the applicant processing pipeline as submissions move through AI evaluation.

Key Features

Live workflow progress
Processing queue
AI evaluation status
Applicant scores
System health
Throughput metrics
Processing statistics

Primary Users

Operations teams
Recruiters
Platform administrators


## Partner Intake Dashboard

![Partner Intake Dashboard for managing agency-specific applicant submissions and intake sources.](../../assets/frontend/02-partner-intake-dashboard.png)

Purpose

Displays submissions received from partner agencies or external talent partners.

Recruiters can browse incoming applicants, filter submissions, and prioritize candidates before they enter the primary evaluation pipeline.

Key Features

Partner agency submissions
Agency filtering
Country filtering
Search
Ranking
Candidate prioritization


## Open Call Dashboard

![Open Call Dashboard displaying applicants submitted through public casting calls.](../../assets/frontend/03-open-call-dashboard.png)

Purpose

Manages applicants submitted through public casting calls and recruitment events.

The dashboard provides recruiters with an overview of event participation, submission progress, applicant rankings, and filtering capabilities.

Key Features

Event statistics
Applicant ranking
Filtering
Search
Pagination
Review progress

## Review Queue

![Review Queue showing applicants awaiting human review after automated AI evaluation.](../../assets/frontend/05-review-queue.png)

Purpose

Central workspace for recruiter decision making.

Applicants are presented alongside AI-generated scores and supporting information, allowing recruiters to quickly qualify, waitlist, or reject submissions.

Key Features

AI ranking
Candidate comparison
Search
Filtering
Review workflow
Priority management


## Applicant Profile

![Applicant profile page displaying structured candidate information, AI analysis, and uploaded media.](../../assets/frontend/06-applicant-profile.png)

Purpose

Provides a complete view of an individual applicant.

This page combines uploaded media, applicant information, AI evaluation results, recruiter notes, and decision actions into a single interface.

Key Features

Applicant profile
Image gallery
AI radar chart
Attribute scores
Recruiter actions
AI assessment
Metadata


## Expanded Applicant Profile

![Expanded applicant profile showing detailed evaluation, AI insights, media analysis, and review history.](../../assets/frontend/07-applicant-profile-expanded.png)

Purpose

Allows recruiters to inspect uploaded media in greater detail while reviewing AI-generated evaluations.

The expanded view supports deeper candidate analysis without leaving the review workflow.

Key Features

High-resolution media
Multiple uploaded photos
AI score visualization
Attribute breakdown
Decision actions


## Image Authenticity Analysis

![Image authenticity analysis displaying AI-generated media forensics and manipulation detection results.](../../assets/frontend/10-image-authenticity-analysis.png)

Purpose

Displays the results of AI-powered media integrity analysis.

Potential image manipulation, AI generation, metadata inconsistencies, and authenticity concerns are surfaced before recruiter review.

Key Features

Authenticity score
Heatmap visualization
Manipulation indicators
Metadata analysis
AI-generated risk
Recommended action


## Post-Qualification Pipeline

![Pipeline management view for qualified applicants progressing through recruitment stages.](../../assets/frontend/08-post-qualification-pipeline.png)

Purpose

Tracks applicants after they have successfully passed the initial AI evaluation and recruiter review.

Recruiters can monitor every stage of the recruitment lifecycle until onboarding or roster placement.

Typical stages include:

Interview
Test Shoot
Due Diligence
Contract Review
Signing
Roster Synchronization


## Pipeline Workspace

![Pipeline workspace sidebar showing recruitment stages and applicant navigation.](../../assets/frontend/09-post-qualification-pipeline-sidebar.png)

Purpose

Provides an operational view of the post-qualification recruitment pipeline.

Recruiters can monitor candidate progress, update pipeline stages, assign actions, and coordinate the recruitment process through to completion.

Design Principles

The frontend is designed around several principles:

AI-Assisted Decision Making — AI provides recommendations while recruiters retain final decision authority.
Workflow Visibility — Every applicant's progress is visible throughout the recruitment lifecycle.
Centralized Information — Applicant data, AI evaluations, media, and recruiter actions are presented in a single interface.
Operational Efficiency — Search, filtering, ranking, and pipeline management reduce manual administrative work.
Scalability — The interface is designed to support high-volume recruitment workflows across multiple organizations.